  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Uniform Wire Format",
      "items": [
        "RPC Layer 下所有 4 传输进同一 Frame Codec；maxFrameBytes 一致；P2PCommand 序号是路由唯一 ID"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Crypto Mode Contract",
      "items": [
        "PLAIN=无加密；RANDOM=会话随机密钥；AUTH_SIG=双方握手证书签名；CERT_CHAIN=真实 X509 链；模式可逐连接独立选择"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Cancel Contract",
      "items": [
        "RPC StdCancel 语义：Java SDK cancel() → server STOP frame；Dart Python C TS 一致；p2p-core-wire-format 跨语言对齐"
      ]
    }
